<div id="pf42" class="pf w0 h0" data-page-no="42"><div class="pc pc42 w0 h0"><img class="bi x0 y109d w1 h54" alt="" src="bg42.png"/><div class="t m0 x4 hb y33 ff9 fs1 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">7<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _13"> </span>深度学习及其优化算法</span></div><div class="t m0 xc hf y14 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">第<span class="_ _d"> </span><span class="ff6">7<span class="_ _d"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _d"> </span><span class="ff9 fc6"><span class="_ _f"> </span></span>深度学习及其优化算法</div><div class="t m0 xf h10 y64 ff9 fs4 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ff6">7.1<span class="_ _5f"> </span><span class="ff1">深度神经网络基础<span class="_ _e"> </span></span>(F<span class="_ _28"></span>oundations<span class="_ _8"> </span>of<span class="_ _8"> </span>Deep<span class="_ _e"> </span>Neural<span class="_ _20"> </span>Netw<span class="_ _28"></span>orks)</span></div><div class="t m0 xe h6 y65 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">在最优化方法的演进中，从线性模型过渡到深度学习模型是一个质的飞跃。线性模型<span class="_ _17"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑓<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ffa">(<span class="_ _1"></span></span>𝑥<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ffb">;<span class="_ _10"> </span></span>𝑊<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffa">)<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _0"> </span></span></span>𝑊<span class="_ _12"></span>𝑥<span class="_ _2"> </span></span>虽然形</div><div class="t m0 x4 h6 y599 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">式简单且易于通过凸优化求解，<span class="_ _5"></span>但其表征能力<span class="_ _5"></span>（<span class="ff3">Capacity</span>）受到线性空间的限制，<span class="_ _28"></span>无法处理现实世界中复杂的非</div><div class="t m0 x4 h6 y109e ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">线性模式。深度学习通过堆叠多层非线性变换，构建了能够逼近任意连续函数的通用近似器。</div><div class="t m0 xf h16 y109f ff6 fs6 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.1.1<span class="_ _21"> </span><span class="ff1">神经元与网络架构</span></div><div class="t m0 xe h6 y10a0 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">神经网络的基本构建模块是人工神经元（<span class="ff3">Articial Neuron</span>）<span class="_ _29"></span>，其设计灵感来源于生物神经系统，但在数学形</div><div class="t m0 x4 h6 y10a1 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">式上进行了抽象与简化。</div><div class="t m0 xe h6 y10a2 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">定义<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">7.1.1<span class="_ _0"> </span>(</span>人工神经元<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Articial<span class="_ _0"> </span>Neur<span class="_ _3"></span>on))</span></div><div class="t m0 x10 h11 y10a3 ffa fs1 fc9 sc0 ls0 ws0">♣</div><div class="t m0 x53 h3 y10a4 ff2 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">人工神经元是一个计算单元，<span class="_ _4"></span>它接收一组输入信号<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑥<span class="_ _20"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _20"> </span><span class="ffa">(<span class="_ _1"></span></span></span>𝑥</span></div><div class="t m0 xac h13 y10a5 ffb fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">1</div><div class="t m0 x42 h12 y10a4 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">,<span class="_ _19"> </span>.<span class="_ _19"> </span>.<span class="_ _c"> </span>.<span class="_ _19"> </span>,<span class="_ _10"> </span>𝑥</div><div class="t m0 x5a h14 y10a5 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑛</div><div class="t m0 x92 h3 y10a4 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">)<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff2">，<span class="_ _4"></span>对其进行线性加权求和，<span class="_ _4"></span>并添加偏置</span></div><div class="t m0 x53 h3 y10a6 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑏<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff2">，最后通过一个非线性激活函数<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>𝜎<span class="_ _12"></span><span class="ffa">(<span class="_ _1"></span>·<span class="_ _1"></span>)<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff2">输出结果。数学表达如下：</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x85 h12 y10a7 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑦<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _2"> </span></span>𝜎</div><div class="t m0 xa6 h1c y10a8 ff11 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> </div><div class="t m0 x76 h14 y10a9 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑛</div><div class="t m0 x46 h18 y10aa fff fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"></div><div class="t m0 x8a h14 y10ab ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑖<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ffd">=<span class="ffb">1</span></span></div><div class="t m0 xba h12 y10a7 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑤</div><div class="t m0 x47 h14 y10ac ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑖</div><div class="t m0 xd1 h12 y10a7 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑥</div><div class="t m0 xa0 h14 y10ac ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑖</div><div class="t m0 x36 h11 y10a7 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">+<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑏</span></div><div class="t m0 xf7 h1c y10a8 ff11 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">!</div><div class="t m0 xa7 h11 y10a7 ffd fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">=<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff8">𝜎<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffa">(<span class="_ _15"></span></span>𝑤</span></div><div class="t m0 xad h14 y10ad ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇</div><div class="t m0 xf9 h11 y10a7 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑥<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">+<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>𝑏<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ffa">)</span></div><div class="t m0 x53 h3 y10ae ff2 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">其中<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑤<span class="_ _2"> </span></span>是权重向量，<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff8">𝑏<span class="_ _2"> </span></span>是偏置标量。</div><div class="t m0 x53 h6 y10af ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">生物学对应与计算意义：</div><div class="t m0 xfd h6 y10b0 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">树突<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Dendrites)<span class="ff4">：对应输入向量<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑥<span class="_ _1"></span></span>，负责从其他神经元接收信号。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 xfd h6 y10b1 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">突触<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Synapse)<span class="ff4">：对应权重<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑤<span class="_ _15"></span></span>，调节信号的强度。权重的正负分别代表兴奋性与抑制性连接。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 xfd h6 y10b2 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">细胞体<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Cell<span class="_ _0"> </span>Body)<span class="ff4">：对应线性组合</span></span></div><div class="t m0 xb0 h18 y10b3 fff fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"></div><div class="t m0 xe4 h12 y10b2 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑤</div><div class="t m0 x15 h14 y10b4 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑖</div><div class="t m0 x105 h12 y10b2 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑥</div><div class="t m0 x8b h14 y10b4 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑖</div><div class="t m0 xd1 h6 y10b2 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">+<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑏<span class="_ _1"></span><span class="ff4">，在空间上整合输入信息。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 xfd h6 y10b5 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">轴突<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Axon)<span class="ff4">：对应激活函数<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff8">𝜎<span class="_ _15"></span><span class="ffa">(<span class="_ _1"></span>·)<span class="_ _20"> </span></span></span>及输出<span class="_ _20"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑦<span class="_ _1"></span></span>。生物神经元<span class="_ _1"></span>的发放频率（<span class="ff3">Firing Rate</span>）被抽象为激活函</span></span></div><div class="t m0 xfd h6 y10b6 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">数的输出值。</div><div class="t m0 x53 h6 y10b7 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">注意：<span class="_ _3d"></span><span class="ff4">生物神经元具有复杂的时空动力学特性和脉冲编码机制，<span class="_ _3d"></span>而人工神经元通常是静态的实值函数。<span class="_ _3d"></span>尽</span></div><div class="t m0 x53 h6 y10b8 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">管如此，<span class="_ _3c"></span>这种分层结构使得网络能够学习从低级特征<span class="_ _3d"></span>（如边缘）<span class="_ _2b"></span>到高级语义<span class="_ _3d"></span>（如物体分类）<span class="_ _2b"></span>的层次化表示。</div><div class="t m0 xf h16 y10b9 ff6 fs6 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.1.2<span class="_ _21"> </span><span class="ff1">多层感知机与全连接网络</span></div><div class="t m0 xe h6 y10ba ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">多层感知机（<span class="ff3">MLP</span>）是最基础的深度网络结构，由输入层、若干隐藏层和输出层组成。</div><div class="t m0 x4 hb y62 ff9 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _36"> </span><span class="fc6"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">61<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _36"> </span><span class="fc8"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
